<title>USA: Campbell Soup Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Campbell Soup Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.34		    $0.29</p>
<p> Net			157,000		  145,000</p>
<p> Net Sales	    1,870,000		1,831,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 464,000		  498,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.09		    $1.25</p>
<p> Net			521,000		  621,000</p>
<p> Net Sales	    6,239,000		6,038,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 476,000		  498,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Contributions to earnings by divisions include the effects of a first quarter fiscal 1997 restructuring charge of $216.3 million as follows: U.S.A. $152.4 million, Bakery &amp; Confectionery $56.4 million and International Grocery $7.5 million.  The consolidated after tax effect was $160.4 million, or $.33 per share.</p>
